Problem6:
Let m[0]…m[4] be mutexes (binary semaphores) and P[0]…P[4] be processes. Suppose each process P[i] executes the following:
wait(m[i]);
wait(m[(i+1) mod 4]);
………….
release(m[i]);
release(m[(i+1) mod 4]);

This could cause-
1. Thrashing
2. Deadlock
3. Starvation but not deadlock
4. None of the above

