Davidis a  hardware engineer.Hecame up with a great idea which can help in solving the critical section problemand that hecalled it as atomic counters. An atomic counter is a variable in memory that can be sampled and incremented in one atomic operation. Also, it can be reset to 0. That is, the two opreations allowed on the shared variable a are:
j = a++;// execute in one atomic operationa = 0;
Show that whether this technique is possible if yes implement it.

Solution: 
This hardware solution can help implement a solution to the C.S. as follows: 
atomic inside = 0; // inside is an atomic counter
 int a; 
while(true) 
{ a = inside++;
 if(a != 1) 
goto retry;
 /* enter C.S. */
 ...
 /* exit C.S. */ 
inside = 0; 
}

